- name: note
  id: note
  parameters:
    content: 'PLUTO DIGITAL VOICE HD - WORKING BUILD


      16 kHz mono -> Opus 16 kbps CBR / 20 ms -> CRC32 -> K=7 rate-1/2 FEC -> 22x34 interleave -> preamble + sync -> differential Gray QPSK -> RRC alpha 0.25.


      424 QPSK symbols every 20 ms at 21.2 ksym/s. Baseband 84.8 kS/s. Pluto stream 678.4 kS/s. Approx. waveform bandwidth class 26.5 kHz. Pluto RF filter remains 200 kHz minimum.


      RX: software channel LPF -> FLL -> RRC/Gardner -> Costas -> constellation -> differential decode -> frame sync -> Viterbi -> CRC -> Opus PLC -> speaker.


      Install opuslib + system libopus. Start with cabled TX -> attenuator -> RX. Never connect TX directly to RX. Use only authorized frequencies, power and duty cycle.'
  states:
    bus_sink: false
    bus_source: false
    bus_structure: null
    coordinate: [80, 750]
    rotation: 0
    state: enabled
